	"data": "Orchestrator\n\nDialog and visual-scripting subsystem for 2D and 3D games in Godot.\nRepo: <https://github.com/Vahera/godot-orchestrator>\nLicense: Check repo\nGodot version: 4.x\nStatus: Active, listed in awesome-godot\n\nWhat It Provides\nVisual scripting editor inside Godot\nNode-based logic graphs\nDialog system with branching\n2D and 3D game support\nMore general than ProtonGraph — handles game logic, not just procedural content\n\nRelevance to Spatial Authoring\nThe visual scripting graph is the closest…",
